<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <!--
    Wuxia inspirations (docs/revision/REVISION_TraitsDestinies.md): the vanilla inspiration system (high mood → a
    chance; restless heart: after a breakdown). Only awakened cultivators after the Convergence
    (Convergence.InspirationWorker_Cultivator).
  -->
  <InspirationDef>
    <defName>CVG_Inspired_Enlightenment</defName>
    <label>sudden enlightenment</label>
    <workerClass>Convergence.InspirationWorker_Cultivator</workerClass>
    <baseCommonality>0.6</baseCommonality>
    <baseDurationDays>3</baseDurationDays>
    <beginLetter>[PAWN_pronoun] has glimpsed the Dao. For the next 3 days [PAWN_pronoun] cultivates much faster and breaks through more surely.\n\nThe old masters called it dunwu, sudden awakening: years of patience paid in a single breath.</beginLetter>
    <beginLetterDef>PositiveEvent</beginLetterDef>
    <endMessage>{0} is no longer inspired (sudden enlightenment).</endMessage>
    <baseInspectLine>Inspired: sudden enlightenment</baseInspectLine>
    <minAge>13</minAge>
      <statFactors>
        <CVG_CultivationSpeed>2.5</CVG_CultivationSpeed>
      </statFactors>
      <statOffsets>
        <CVG_BreakthroughChance>0.1</CVG_BreakthroughChance>
      </statOffsets>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_InspirationDao">
        <daoComprehension>3</daoComprehension>
        <traitCounter>Enlightenment</traitCounter>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>

  </InspirationDef>

  <InspirationDef>
    <defName>CVG_Inspired_SwordIntent</defName>
    <label>sword intent</label>
    <workerClass>Convergence.InspirationWorker_Cultivator</workerClass>
    <baseCommonality>0.6</baseCommonality>
    <baseDurationDays>4</baseDurationDays>
    <beginLetter>A sword intent has awakened in [PAWN_objective]. For the next 4 days [PAWN_possessive] blows land more often and cut deeper.\n\nSword cultivators say the intent chooses the swordsman, not the other way around.</beginLetter>
    <beginLetterDef>PositiveEvent</beginLetterDef>
    <endMessage>{0} is no longer inspired (sword intent).</endMessage>
    <baseInspectLine>Inspired: sword intent</baseInspectLine>
    <minAge>13</minAge>
      <statOffsets>
        <MeleeHitChance>6</MeleeHitChance>
      </statOffsets>
      <statFactors>
        <MeleeDamageFactor>1.2</MeleeDamageFactor>
      </statFactors>
      <associatedSkills>
        <li>Melee</li>
      </associatedSkills>
  </InspirationDef>

  <InspirationDef>
    <defName>CVG_Inspired_ForgeFire</defName>
    <label>forge fire</label>
    <workerClass>Convergence.InspirationWorker_Cultivator</workerClass>
    <baseCommonality>0.6</baseCommonality>
    <baseDurationDays>4</baseDurationDays>
    <beginLetter>The fire of Gan Jiang and Mo Ye burns in [PAWN_possessive] hands. For the next 4 days [PAWN_pronoun] forges and works much faster.\n\nThe legendary smiths threw themselves into their furnace to finish a pair of swords; this fire asks less.</beginLetter>
    <beginLetterDef>PositiveEvent</beginLetterDef>
    <endMessage>{0} is no longer inspired (forge fire).</endMessage>
    <baseInspectLine>Inspired: forge fire</baseInspectLine>
    <minAge>13</minAge>
      <statFactors>
        <CVG_ForgeSpeed>1.8</CVG_ForgeSpeed>
        <WorkSpeedGlobal>1.2</WorkSpeedGlobal>
      </statFactors>
      <associatedSkills>
        <li>Crafting</li>
      </associatedSkills>
      <requiredNonDisabledWorkTags>Crafting</requiredNonDisabledWorkTags>
  </InspirationDef>

</Defs>
